{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2022-05-26 05:00:00', 'title': 'BEN FELLER, ACCLAIMED STORYTELLING STRATEGIST AND FORMER AP CHIEF WHITE HOUSE CORRESPONDENT, JOINS MASLANSKY + PARTNERS IN TOP LEADERSHIP ROLE', 'text': 'FELLER NAMED PARTNER AT THE AGENCY THAT INVENTED LANGUAGE STRATEGY(R)\xa0 NEW YORK , MAY 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LEADING LANGUAGE STRATEGY®\xa0FIRM, MASLANSKY + PARTNERS (M+P), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT BEN FELLER, THE\xa0FORMER ASSOCIATED PRESS CHIEF WHITE HOUSE CORRESPONDENT, WILL BE JOINING AS A PARTNER. AN AWARD-WINNING WRITER AND RENOWNED STORYTELLING STRATEGIST, FELLER WILL SERVE AS A GLOBAL LEAD IN COUNSELING CLIENTS ON HOW TO USE THE POWER OF LANGUAGE TO DRIVE REAL CHANGE IN ATTITUDES, BEHAVIOR AND OUTCOMES.'}